# 🇮🇳 Law & Policy Decoder

AI-powered RAG chatbot for Indian government schemes.

## Features

- PDF-based scheme understanding
- Eligibility question answering
- Simple-language explanations
- Source-based reasoning
- Streamlit UI

## Tech Stack

- Python
- Streamlit
- LangChain
- ChromaDB
- Gemini API

## Run Locally

### Install dependencies

pip install -r requirements.txt

### Run app

streamlit run app.py
